1. Outfit
---------

    Files:      web/public/fonts/Outfit-Regular.woff2
                web/public/fonts/Outfit-Medium.woff2
    License:    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    Text:       web/public/fonts/OFL.txt
    Upstream:   https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/outfit
    Revision:   8b0a1d0f5983c89bc2b93f1b5fb55f9e252744b5
    Source:     Outfit[wght].ttf
                sha256 fc7287273e66929776e2ba54f144fe699080bec29f61bf649d70d871468aeade

Instanced at weights 400 and 500, subset to the Google Fonts latin range, and
compressed to WOFF2. Outfit declares no Reserved Font Name, so instancing,
subsetting and redistribution under the family name are permitted.

Outfit is the UI face in builds from this repository. Readyset's official
builds use a different, commercially licensed face; the metric descriptors in
web/src/fonts.css retarget Outfit onto the same line box and x-height, so
layout does not change between the two.


