                web/public/fonts/IBMPlexMono-Medium.woff2
    License:    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    Text:       web/public/fonts/OFL.txt
    Copyright:  Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp. with Reserved Font Name "Plex"
    Upstream:   https://github.com/IBM/plex

Shipped unchanged. WOFF2 conversion is not a modification under OFL-FAQ 2.2,
so the Reserved Font Name imposes no renaming duty. These files are not
subset — subsetting *is* a modification under OFL-FAQ 2.6 and would oblige a
rename.


